+{{/*
+Canonical digest of the runtime-relevant merged Helm values used to render one
+deployment. The onboarding trust/transport block and public Secret rollout
+generation are independently bound and excluded to avoid a self-reference when
+new signed observations are staged. Production forbids arbitrary env and
+chart-rendered secret bytes, so the remaining JSON binds the reviewed
+non-secret runtime configuration without a digest copied from the evidence.
+*/}}
