+
+| Signal | Ready threshold | First response |
+|--------|-----------------|----------------|
+| `shield_enforcing` | `1` | Verify the installed Shield and all input/tool/output sinks; quarantine work touched during a failure. |
+| `shield_failures`, `shield_bypasses` | `0` since process start | Treat bypass as a security incident; repair the scanner before restoring readiness. |
