+## Install tenant RLS as the migration owner
+
+Root tables use exact `tenant_id` equality. Tables such as episodes, events,
+turns, messages, questions, attachments, artifacts, share links, signoffs, goal
+origins, and approval signoffs use a parent-derived `EXISTS` policy. A foreign
+key alone does not protect those child tables from direct SQL, so every root and
+child policy must be enabled and forced before the runtime starts.
