+maverick tenant backfill --tenant <legacy-owner-id>
+maverick tenant rls-preflight
+maverick tenant rls-apply --confirm-drained
+```
+
+The bulk backfill is safe only when all legacy NULL roots belong to that one
+tenant. If they mix customers, use a reviewed row-level mapping instead. An
+orphan or nullable-parent child is never assigned implicitly; preflight and
+apply refuse it. `rls-apply` locks the complete allow-listed table set, rechecks
