+deletes children before parents, disables only the named flow-authority trigger,
+restores the trigger and FORCE RLS, verifies every erasable residual is zero,
+and commits. Existing immutable subject-erasure receipts remain under their
+seven-year retention triggers. The value-free digested report gates local
+finalization; local failures leave a suspended tenant and a zero-row rerun can
+finish safely. Never switch backend config to bypass this gate.
