+## API compatibility, deprecation, and migration
+
+The first-profile API contract is version `5.0.0` and has lifecycle status
+`unpublished-release-candidate`. It is exact rather than permissive: any schema
+change, including an apparently additive one, changes the production schema
+digest and blocks production startup until a reviewer deliberately updates the
+versioned artifact. Because no supported release exists yet, this repository
+contract is not a backward-compatibility promise to customers.
