+## Production admission
+
+These variables are deployment assertions for the signed, deliberately narrow
+production artifact. Do not set them on a general-purpose image to make it
+*look* production-ready; the startup verifier reconciles them with the pinned
+manifest and the live configuration, and the supported Helm profile emits the
+transport assertions only after rendering the matching resources.
