+    drained migration-owner workflow.  A registry row is published suspended
+    before the filesystem mutation and remains suspended as an offboarding
+    tombstone, so a failure or later accidental restart cannot silently
+    reactivate a partially finalized tenant.  Re-running with the same or a
+    fresh zero-row Postgres report is safe.
